OL,3,ACrypto giant Binance hit by $6.3bn hack
OL,4,Athought to be largest in history
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlockchain intelligence firm TRM Labs
OL,7,Fsays several elements of the Binance
OL,8,Fattack resemble earlier North
OL,9,FKorean-linked incidents, including last
OL,10,Fyear's $1.5bn Bybit hack
OL,12,FThe company also says this latest hack
OL,13,Fcould be the largest in history
OL,15,FBinance didn't directly respond to
OL,16,Fquestions about the incident's
OL,17,Fpotential links to North Korea, but has
OL,18,Fsaid: "We are working closely with our
OL,19,Flaw enforcement partners to confirm the
OL,20,Fidentity of these criminals and bring
OL,21,Fthem to justice"
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
